# Step 1 — Azure Portal > App Registrations > New Registration
#   Supported account types : Personal Microsoft accounts only
#   Redirect URI             : Single-page application (SPA) > http://localhost:3000
#   Then: API permissions > Microsoft Graph > Delegated > Files.ReadWrite + User.Read
MSAL_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here

# Step 2 — Get the file ID from Graph Explorer:
#   GET https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/root/children
#   Copy the "id" field of your Excel file.
#   The Excel file must have a sheet named exactly:  Table 1
ONEDRIVE_FILE_ID=your-file-id-here
